name the Sell dialog offers Sell now / Stop-loss and stays vanilla until Stop-loss is picked
show-buy Oil
click FinanceOverhaulOrderTab-Limit
close-dialog
show-sell Oil
expect-visible FinanceOverhaulOrderTab-MarketSell
expect-visible FinanceOverhaulOrderTab-StopLossSell
expect-hidden FinanceOverhaulOrderTab-Limit
expect-hidden FinanceOverhaulLimitPrice
expect-visible PanelSellStats
expect-text Button Sell
expect-no-overflow
cleanup:
close-dialog
